  "description": "<p>Reported by Jasper Op de Coul - <a href=\"http://fedora-commons.1317035.n2.nabble.com/versionable-attribute-on-modifyDatastream-td5066130.html#a5066130\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora-commons.1317035.n2.nabble.com/versionable-attribute-on-modifyDatastream-td5066130.html#a5066130</a></p>\n\n<p>Test case:<br/>\n(1) curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -T dc.xml -v <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fedora/objects/changeme:1/datastreams/DC?dsState=A&amp;versionable=false\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fedora/objects/changeme:1/datastreams/DC?dsState=A\\&amp;versionable=false</a></p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>verify datastream versionable is set to false<br/>\n(2) curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -T dc.xml -v <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fedora/objects/changeme:1/datastreams/DC\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fedora/objects/changeme:1/datastreams/DC</a></li>\n\t<li>datastream state has now been updated to true (it should not have been)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>See \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-608\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-608\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Put /objects/{pid} (modifyObject) has state default to A, so will always set objects active, unless told not to\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10300?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-608\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n for a similar issue with object state.</p>",
